---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Buy TotalRecalls" description="One-time $24 launch price via Lemon Squeezy. No subscription.">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Buy TotalRecalls</h1>

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-12 rounded-lg mb-12">
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Launch Price</h2>
      <div class="text-4xl font-semibold mb-3">$24</div>
      <div class="text-gray-600 mb-6">One-time purchase · Windows app · Local files only</div>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Pay once with Lemon Squeezy. You'll receive a download link for the Windows app immediately after purchase.</p>
      <a href="" data-tr-buy class="inline-block w-full bg-black text-white text-center py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-800">Buy for $24</a>
      <div id="checkout-pending" class="mt-4 p-3 bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded text-sm text-yellow-800">
        Checkout link not configured — button will be enabled once lemonCheckoutUrl is set in config.js.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">What You Get</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
      <li>Export from ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini (Takeout), Grok</li>
      <li>Local Markdown + JSON files under your Library folder</li>
      <li>No telemetry · No background services · No installers</li>
      <li>Free minor updates during the launch period</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Refund Policy</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700">All sales are final (digital download). Try the free guides first to verify the tool meets your needs.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-gray-100 py-12 rounded-lg text-center">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Already purchased?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Download the ZIP directly from your receipt email or click below.</p>
    <a href="/download/" class="inline-block bg-gray-900 text-white py-3 px-6 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-800">Go to Download</a>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
